uthenticates with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that credential. It’s the "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/www.w3.org\/TR\/webauthn-3\/#prf-extension","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for credential-bound key derivation, built on the CTAP2 "},{"code":"hmac-secret","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" extension."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The SDK transforms each PRF input with ","type":"text"},{"code":"SHA-256(\"WebAuthn PRF\\0\" || input)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sending it to the authenticator — that domain separation is mandated by the spec."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In a high-level WebAuthn flow, configure ","type":"text"},{"code":"PRF","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" per ceremony via","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/RegistrationInputs\/prf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/yubikit-swift.YubiKit\/documentation\/YubiKit\/WebAuthn\/Extension\/AuthenticationInputs\/prf","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"; outputs come back on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"clientExtensionResults","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" of the corresponding "},{"code":"Response","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Registration enables"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PRF on a credential, optionally deriving secrets at the same time on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"authenticators that support hmac-secret-mc. Authentication evaluates the PRF at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one or more inputs and returns the derived bytes."}]},{"code":["\/\/ Registration: enable PRF on the new credential","let regOpts